*  FORMS for delivery goods movements in alphabetical order           *
*  ------------------------------------------------------------------ *
*  Buchstabe H:                                                       *
*  Letter H:                                                          *
*        PERFORM HU_GET_TABLES.                                       *
*        PERFORM HU_COPY_SERNR_TO_LIPS.                               *
*        PERFORM HU_CREATE_LIVE.                                      *
*        PERFORM HU_SET_MEMORY.                                       *
*        PERFORM HU_FILL_HU_IMSEG.                                    *
*        PERFORM HU_FILL_BEFI_HU_IMSEG.                               *
*        PERFORM HU_FILL_HUMSEG_HU.                                   *
